# Notes on PTIOS, read by tools/dis703.py when it writes ptios.asm: names,
# comments and code/data hints by the tape's address (see Notes in the tool).
# PTIOS's own SYM source is on the museum's PTIOS_SYM tape, so its names
# are to be had from there rather than made up.
0080 > The Paper Tape I/O System, as the museum's site ran it in place of X-RAY.
0080 > It copies its words from X'E2' on to word 0 and runs them there.
